SO LONG,
NO LESS THAN 95% MEAT
AND MEAT BYPRODUCTS.

1918
01:26:17,733 --> 01:26:19,367
THEY DID CHICKEN RIGHT.

1919
01:26:19,400 --> 01:26:20,700
YES.

1920
01:26:23,733 --> 01:26:26,300
[NARRATOR]
WHAT, THEN,
WILL THE FUTURE REVEAL--

1921
01:26:26,333 --> 01:26:28,533
- UGLY GUYS!
- ...IF THIS STORY

1922
01:26:28,567 --> 01:26:30,800
IS ONLY THE BEGINNING--

1923
01:26:30,833 --> 01:26:34,033
IS ONLY THE BEGINNING--
ONLY THE BEGINNING...

1924
01:26:34,067 --> 01:26:36,467
OH, DON'T TAKE MY
MICROPHONE AWAY. I'M FINE.

1925
01:26:36,500 --> 01:26:38,167
OH, NO!

1926
01:26:38,200 --> 01:26:40,367
THAT MEANS WE'RE GONNA
HAVE TO WATCH IT ALL OVER AGAIN!

1927
01:26:40,400 --> 01:26:41,500
NO!

1928
