YEAH, THAT'S GREAT.
HEY, THANKS, MIKE.

1929
01:26:56,500 --> 01:26:59,133
MAN, I WISH I COULD
DO THIS MYSELF.

1930
01:26:59,167 --> 01:27:00,867
- [BLOWS]
- WELL, HI, GUYS.

1931
01:27:00,900 --> 01:27:02,333
- HI, CROW.
- HEY, CROW.

1932
01:27:02,367 --> 01:27:04,200
HEY, UM, HAVE YOU GUYS
EVER NOTICED

1933
01:27:04,233 --> 01:27:07,533
HOW I'LL SEE A MOVIE, SNAP,
LOSE CONTROL OF MYSELF

1934
01:27:07,567 --> 01:27:09,633
AND DECIDE I'M ONE OF
THE CHARACTERS IN THE MOVIE,

1935
01:27:09,667 --> 01:27:11,967
AND THEN GO OUT
AND DRESS MYSELF UP THAT WAY?

1936
01:27:12,000 --> 01:27:14,700
I DON'T KNOW IF YOU DO THAT
ANY MORE THAN THE REST OF US.

1937
01:27:14,733 --> 01:27:16,333
YEAH, I ACTUALLY DO, MIKE.

1938
01:27:16,367 --> 01:27:18,800
I GUESS I'M PRETTY GOOD
AT HIDING IT.
BUT LOOK AT ME!

1939
01:27:18,833 --> 01:27:20,867
APPARENTLY I'VE DECIDED
I'M A SOLARITE.

1940
01:27:20,900 --> 01:27:22,967
- HUH.
- HMM. YEAH.

1941
01:27:23,000 --> 01:27:24,333
AND YOU KNOW WHAT'S WEIRD?

1942
01:27:24,367 --> 01:27:26,167
I DON'T EVEN REMEMBER
DOING THIS.

1943
01:27:26,200 --> 01:27:28,167
AND IT'S A VERY GOOD COSTUME!

1944
01:27:28,200 --> 01:27:30,133
- MM. PRETTY GOOD.
- YEAH, IT IS.

1945
01:27:30,167 --> 01:27:31,633
WITH THE EYES
AND THE NOSE AND ALL.

1946
01:27:31,667 --> 01:27:33,967
YEAH, APPARENTLY DONE
IN A SICK, PSYCHOTIC,

1947
01:27:34,000 --> 01:27:36,033
AMNESIC BLACKOUT OR SOMETHING.

1948
01:27:36,067 --> 01:27:38,467
AND FOR WHAT?
AM I SCARY AT ALL?

1949
01:27:38,500 --> 01:27:40,800
- LOOK. LOOK.
- WELL, NO.

1950
01:27:40,833 --> 01:27:42,800
YOU LOOK LIKE A CLOWN.
OR LIKE A FOOL, RIGHT?

1951
01:27:42,833 --> 01:27:44,800
- OR LIKE A JERK.
- LIKE A JERK. THAT'S MY POINT.

1952
01:27:44,833 --> 01:27:47,833
APPARENTLY I HATE MYSELF,
I CRAVE RIDICULE.

1953
01:27:47,867 --> 01:27:49,833
HIT ME WITH SCORN
AND DERISIVE LAUGHTER.

1954
01:27:49,867 --> 01:27:52,133
THAT MAKES ME ALL TINGLY.

1955
01:27:52,167 --> 01:27:55,300
OH, HI. I'M CROW.
ABUSE ME, PLEASE. THANK YOU.

1956
01:27:55,333 --> 01:27:57,633
- AGH! BOY!
- HUH.

1957
01:27:57,667 --> 01:27:59,967
[SIGHS]
WHAT THE...

1958
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:01,800
[SIGHS]
HEY, YOU KNOW WHAT?

1959
01:28:01,833 --> 01:28:04,300
I HOPE IT'S OKAY
THAT I TALK ABOUT THIS
WITH YOU GUYS.

1960
01:28:04,333 --> 01:28:06,167
OH, NO, NO.
IT'S VERY PLEASANT.
THIS IS FUN.

1961
01:28:06,200 --> 01:28:08,000
WELL, THANKS.
THANKS A LOT, YOU GUYS.

1962
01:28:08,033 --> 01:28:09,867
I ACTUALLY FEEL A LITTLE BETTER.

1963
01:28:09,900 --> 01:28:11,800
I'M-- I'M GONNA
GO DO SOME JOURNALING.

1964
01:28:11,833 --> 01:28:14,133
- YEAH. OKAY.
- YOU DO THAT. GOOD LUCK!

1965
01:28:14,167 --> 01:28:15,800
WHAT A DIPSTICK.

1966
