GEEZ, YOU THINK
CROW'S AN IDIOT?

1970
01:28:25,400 --> 01:28:28,300
CHECK OUT PEARL
"WORLD CONQUEROR" FORRESTER'S

1971
01:28:28,333 --> 01:28:31,700
DOOMSDAY STUPID DEVICE.

1972
01:28:31,733 --> 01:28:34,000
WHAT A PILE OF...

1973
01:28:34,033 --> 01:28:37,800
WHAT IS IT WITH ME?
AM I A COMPLETE LOSER?

1974
01:28:37,833 --> 01:28:40,167
I DON'T KNOW, MIKE.

1975
01:28:40,200 --> 01:28:42,533
MAYBE THIS WHOLE
"TAKING OVER THE WORLD" THING

1976
01:28:42,567 --> 01:28:44,667
IS DUMB.

1977
01:28:44,700 --> 01:28:47,133
WHY DON'T YOU DO IT,
OR SOMETHING?

1978
01:28:47,167 --> 01:28:48,833
UH, PEARL,

1979
01:28:48,867 --> 01:28:51,533
THERE'S A MOB
OF AGITATED VILLAGERS
GATHERED DOWN BELOW,

1980
01:28:51,567 --> 01:28:53,967
WIELDING PITCHFORKS
AND TORCHES.

1981
01:28:54,000 --> 01:28:55,500
SHOULD I ASK THEM UP?

1982
01:28:55,533 --> 01:28:57,200
TERRIFIED VILLAGERS?

1983
01:28:57,233 --> 01:28:59,800
A PACK OF PANICKED PEASANTS

1984
01:28:59,833 --> 01:29:02,633
STORMING THE CASTLE...

1985
01:29:02,667 --> 01:29:04,967
IS IT POSSIBLE THEY FEAR

1986
