AND DESPISE ME
AND WISH ME DEAD?

1987
01:29:07,400 --> 01:29:09,633
- [SINISTER LAUGHTER]
- HOORAY!

1988
01:29:09,667 --> 01:29:11,200
I AM EVIL.

1989
01:29:11,233 --> 01:29:14,667
I AM STARTING
TO TAKE OVER THE WORLD.

1990
01:29:14,700 --> 01:29:18,200
BOBO, BRAIN GUY,
PREPARE THE BOILING OIL.

1991
01:29:18,233 --> 01:29:20,500
- YES, MADAM.
- [EERIE WHIRRING]

1992
01:29:20,533 --> 01:29:22,967
[LAUGHING]

1993
01:29:23,000 --> 01:29:25,133
- YEAH, YOU STUPID KULAKS.
- NAH-NAH!

1994
01:29:25,167 --> 01:29:27,367
YOU THINK YOU CAN BRING ME DOWN?

1995
01:29:27,400 --> 01:29:29,867
NO WAY, JOSé.

1996
01:29:29,900 --> 01:29:33,633
- YOU ARE MESSING
WITH THE WRONG EVIL DESPOT.
- THAT'S RIGHT.

1997
