[WOMAN]
WE'VE BROUGHT YOU A CASSEROLE.

1998
01:29:35,500 --> 01:29:36,833
[MAN]
WELCOME TO THE NEIGHBORHOOD.
HUZZAH!

1999
01:29:36,867 --> 01:29:38,467
[WOMAN]
LET US IN!

2000
01:29:38,500 --> 01:29:40,467
A CASSEROLE?
I'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

2001
01:29:40,500 --> 01:29:43,033
OH, WE EAT TONIGHT!
[LAUGHING]

2002
01:29:47,733 --> 01:29:49,700
PEARL, IF IT'S
ANY COMFORT AT ALL,

2003
01:29:49,733 --> 01:29:52,133
- [SQUEALS]
- ...PLEASE KNOW
THAT I HATE YOU

2004
01:29:52,167 --> 01:29:56,533
