- OH, WHY NOT?

2016
01:30:20,033 --> 01:30:21,200
[LAUGHING]

2017
01:30:21,233 --> 01:30:24,367
[BOBO]
HEY! HEY, BRAIN GUY, DOWN HERE!

2018
01:30:24,400 --> 01:30:26,800
OH, WAIT.
ISN'T BOBO DOWN THERE?

2019
01:30:26,833 --> 01:30:28,700
- OH.
- I SUPPOSE WE'D,

2020
01:30:28,733 --> 01:30:31,000
