- [BOBO SCREAMING]
- OOPS.

2022
01:30:32,833 --> 01:30:35,633
- HOW DID THAT HAPPEN?
- [MUTTERING]

2023
01:30:35,667 --> 01:30:38,300
[BOBO YELLING]

2024
01:30:38,333 --> 01:30:40,167
OW! OW! OW!

2025
01:31:39,500 --> 01:31:43,000
YOU KNOW, CAPTAIN,
EVERY YEAR OF MY LIFE,

2026
01:31:43,033 --> 01:31:45,200
I GROW MORE AND MORE CONVINCED

2027
01:31:45,233 --> 01:31:46,833
THAT THE WISEST AND BEST

2028
